---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '海南旅游指南2026——59个国家免签证';
const description = 'Plan your trip to Hainan, China tropical island. 30-day visa-free for 59 countries. Best beaches, food, resorts, and travel tips in one guide.';
const lastUpdated = 'June 2026';
const readTime = '7 min';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">

    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/cities/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to City Guides
      </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏝️ 旅游指南</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Hainan Travel Guide: China's Tropical Island — No Visa Needed for 59 Countries
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">海滩、雨林、火山和世界级的度假胜地，59个国家的公民可以免签证参观长达30天。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新时间：｛lastUpdated｝</span>
        <span>⏱️ {readTime}</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">快速回答</h2>
      <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-800"><strong>海南是中国的热带岛屿天堂，拥有海滩、雨林、火山和世界级的度假胜地，来自59个国家的公民可以免签证访问海南长达30天。</strong> No tour group needed, no embassy visit required. Fly into Haikou or Sanya with your passport and a return ticket, and you're in.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">This is a big deal if you're from the <strong>美国、墨西哥、菲律宾、印度尼西亚或捷克共和国</strong> — these countries aren't on China's mainland 30-day visa-free list. (<a href="/zh/visa/visa-free/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">查看完整的59个国家名单→</a>)</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">☀️</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">热带气候</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">全年平均24°C/75°F</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">🏖️</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">顶级海滩</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">亚龙湾、大东海、海棠湾</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">🌋</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">火山地质公园</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">海口独特的地质</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">🌴</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">雨林</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">五指山、雁塔、霸王岭</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">⛳</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">高尔夫度假村</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">世界级课程</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">🦞</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">新鲜海鲜</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">海南以它而闻名</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Which Countries Qualify (simplified) -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">哪些国家有资格申请海南免签证？</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4"><strong>59个国家</strong> — mostly the same as the mainland visa-free list, but with a few important extras like <strong>美国、墨西哥、菲律宾和印度尼西亚</strong> that aren't on the mainland 30-day list.</p>

      <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-emerald-800"><strong>💡 快速提示：</strong> Unlike the mainland visa-free policies, Hainan's list covers a broader range (59 vs 50 countries). If your country isn't on the <a href="/zh/visa/visa-free/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-medium">大陆免签证名单</a>，看看它是否在海南名单上——这可能是你在中国唯一的免签证选择。</p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">See the <a href="/zh/visa/visa-free/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-medium">按地区分列的59个国家的完整情况→</a></p>
    </section>

    <!-- When to Visit -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">何时游览海南</h2>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">临时</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">人群</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">裁决</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">11月至3月</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">20至28摄氏度</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">🌟 最佳时间——干燥、温暖、完美的海滩天气</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">4月至6月</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">25-32摄氏度</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">适度</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-emerald-600">🌟 Best time — dry, warm, perfect beach weather</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">👍 很好——更热，但游客更少</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">7月至10月</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">资料来源：联合国毒品和犯罪问题办公室全球凶杀案研究，Numbeo安全指数（2025-2026）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">25-32摄氏度</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-amber-600">👍 Good — hotter but fewer tourists</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">⚠️ 下雨——廉价航班，但请查看台风预报</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">旅游旺季：</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">中国新年（1月/2月）和国庆黄金周（10月1日至7日）——如果可以的话，尽量避免。</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">25-32摄氏度</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-red-600">🏖️ 三亚——海滩中心</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><strong>三亚是大多数游客去的地方。想想棕榈树、白沙和高端度假村。</strong> Chinese New Year (Jan/Feb) and National Day Golden Week (Oct 1–7) — avoid if you can.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Where to Go -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">为什么去</h2>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">亚龙湾</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">岛上最好的海滩。清澈的海水，柔软的沙滩，周围环绕着度假胜地。</p>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden mb-6">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">大东海湾</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">更多的当地氛围，更便宜的酒店，海滩上有很多海鲜餐厅。</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">海棠湾</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">更安静，更高档。三亚亚特兰蒂斯酒店（水上公园+水族馆）。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">三亚的其他景点：</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">蜈支洲岛</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">--浮潜和清水一日游</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">南山寺</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">--108米观音像（世界最高）</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>亚诺达雨林</strong> — day trip for snorkeling and clear water</li>
        <li><strong>鹿回头公园</strong> — 108m Guanyin statue (tallest in the world)</li>
        <li><strong>🏛️ 海口——首都</strong> — jungle hiking with waterfalls</li>
        <li><strong>鹿回头公园</strong> — sunset views over Sanya</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">七楼老街</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">--20世纪20年代的拱廊建筑，绝佳的拍照地点</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>火山地质公园</strong> — hike up an extinct volcano crater</li>
        <li><strong>观澜湖</strong> — arcaded buildings from the 1920s, great photo spot</li>
        <li><strong>🗺️ 超越两大城市</strong> — learn about the Li and Miao minority cultures</li>
        <li><strong>为什么访问</strong> — massive resort complex with golf, hot springs, and a film studio theme park</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">一年一度的亚洲论坛小镇。美丽的海滨公路。</h3>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">💡 提示：如果您对尖端的医疗治疗和度假住宿感兴趣，博鳌乐城是中国唯一一个可以获得海外批准的药物和疗法的医疗特区，而这些药物和疗法尚未在大陆上市。</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">五指山</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">“五指山”——岛上最好的徒步旅行</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">兴隆<br>
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">热带植物园+咖啡种植园</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">霸王岭</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">野生雨林，珍稀海南长臂猿</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">海南吃什么</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">菜肴</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">它是什么</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">必须尝试</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What to Eat -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">文昌鸡</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">海南最有名的菜。姜葱汁烧鸡。</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">海口的任何一家当地餐馆</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">嘉吉鸭</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">浓汤慢炖鸭肉</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">海南最著名的菜肴。白切鸡配姜葱酱。</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">海南面</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">肉汤或干米粉</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">到处都是早餐店</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">“五指山”——岛上最好的徒步旅行</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">新鲜螃蟹、大虾、蛤蜊、鱼——烤或蒸</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">三亚海鲜市场（买新鲜的，他们煮）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">椰浆饭</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">椰奶糯米饭</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">夜市</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">清补凉</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">椰奶、豆类、水果、冰甜品汤</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">三亚街头小摊（适合热天）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">海南旅游</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">高速铁路：</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">海南有一条环形高铁线路，连接海口、博鳌、三亚和大多数城镇。火车运行频繁，价格便宜（海口→ 三亚~ 100元，1.5小时）。</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">出租车/滴滴：</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Getting Around -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">轻松叫车穿过</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li><strong>高速铁路：</strong> Hainan has a circular high-speed rail line that connects Haikou, Boao, Sanya, and most towns. Trains run frequently and are cheap (Haikou → Sanya ~¥100, 1.5 hours).</li>
        <li><strong>汽车租赁：</strong> Call a ride easily through the <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">公共汽车：</a> or via Alipay/WeChat mini programs.</li>
        <li><strong>住在哪里</strong> Possible with an International Driving Permit + Chinese translation</li>
        <li><strong>三亚</strong> Cheap but slow, routes cover most tourist spots</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Where to Stay -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">💰 预算（100-200日元）</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">大东海地区旅馆</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">七楼地区宾馆</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">💰💰 中档（300-600日元）</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">亚龙湾度假区（中档）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">观澜湖地区酒店</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">💰💰💰 保费（¥800+）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">亚特兰蒂斯，Edition，丽思卡尔顿酒店（海棠湾）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">希尔顿、万豪酒店（市中心）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">海南的度假村通常比东南亚同等质量的度假村便宜。亚龙湾500日元/晚的客房通常包括早餐，并设有私人海滩区。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">免签证规则——你需要知道的</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">问题</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">回答</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">我能呆多久？</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Visa-Free Rules -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">多达</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden mb-6">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">30天</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">--从您到达后的第二天开始计算</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">我需要旅行团吗？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Up to <strong>我可以延期吗？</strong> — counted from the day after you arrive</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">我可以去中国大陆吗？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3"><strong>罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</strong> — independent solo travelers are fine</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">我可以进入海南，去香港，然后再回来吗？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">是的——每个条目都会重置30天的时钟</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">如果我逾期居留怎么办？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3"><strong>罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</strong> — this policy only covers Hainan island</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">✅ 护照有效期为6+个月</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">✅ 30天内回程或续程机票</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">✅ 酒店预订（推荐）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">✅ 抵达卡（在飞机上或</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">在线填写</p>
      <ol class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-700">
        <li>海南实用小贴士</li>
        <li>使用支付宝或微信支付</li>
        <li>--在飞行前把它们设置好。海南的大多数地方都没有现金。查看我们的</li>
        <li>✅ Arrival card (given on the plane or <a href="/zh/visa/arrival-card/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">导游。</a>)</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- Practical Tips -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">仍然需要VPN</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li><strong>--没有它，谷歌、WhatsApp和Instagram将无法运行。</strong> — set them up before you fly. Most places in Hainan are cashless. See our <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">支付宝、微信支付以及一切与金钱有关的东西</a> guide.</li>
        <li><strong>--在网上（airalo、Holafly）或机场购买。查看我们的</strong> — Google, WhatsApp, Instagram won't work without it. <a href="/zh/life/best-vpns/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">设置VPN</a> before you arrive.</li>
        <li><strong>防晒霜+驱蚊剂</strong> — buy one online (airalo, Holafly) or at the airport. See our <a href="/zh/life/best-sim-esim/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">小费</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>--没想到。查看我们的</strong> — English is not widely spoken in Hainan outside of resorts. Have Google Translate or Pleco ready.</li>
        <li><strong>海南与其他中国入境选择</strong> — both are essentials year-round.</li>
        <li><strong>查看海南的完整59个国家名单</strong> — not expected. See our <a href="/zh/payment/tipping/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">带截图的分步指南</a>.</li>
      </ol>
